   "title": "Read the question",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{The first fall of 556 ft is the first}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{time it hits the ground. Each rebound}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{then adds an upward and a downward trip.}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{The 6th hit comes after 5 rebounds.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
