     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Sum of the rebound heights",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&S_5=417\\cdot\\frac{1-\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^5}{1-\\frac{3}{4}}=1668\\left(1-\\frac{243}{1024}\\right)\\\\[5pt]&{}=1668\\cdot\\frac{781}{1024}=\\frac{1302708}{1024}\\approx 1272.2\\end{aligned}\\]",
